"that changes. With a from/to date range the figures are calculated for that "
"range. Calculating is limited to once per coupon per minute. An affiliate "
"can only read the coupons their own affiliate dashboard shows them: their "
"own and, with multi-level affiliates, those of affiliates below them."
msgstr ""

